<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμᾰλ-ότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>evenness</i> of surface, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐνόπτρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					377b17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1043a24
			</span></i> ; <i>level ground,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόπολις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1330b20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>equability, equilibrium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				57e
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. ἀποβάλλειν,
			ἀπολέσαι,</span> lose <i>equilibrium,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				58e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>evenness</i> of temperature, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1032b7
			</span></i> ; of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.457
			</span></i> ; <i>regularity</i> of motion, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>equality,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					773d
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξευπορεῖν ὁ. ταῖς
			οὐσίαις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				918c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1309b39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
